Pulling the Sprouts — asset sources & licences

Story       The impatient farmer who "helped" his sprouts grow (揠苗助長), classical Chinese parable from the Mencius (public domain), moved to old Japan and retold in original words.
Artwork     Drawn procedurally in code (print.js, nature.js, traveler.js, views.js). Original compositions.
            Print engine, nature and traveller rig adapted from the Lemo-Opuscar library (github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar), MIT License.
Song        Original lyrics (song/lyrics.json); sung and arranged with Suno (clip id in song/clip.json).
Sound FX    Synthesized in code (mix.py + core/audio/sfx.py). No recordings.
Voice       Kokoro TTS v1.0 (kokoro-onnx), Apache-2.0 — voice bm_george (picture clock only, not audible in the sung version).
Fonts       Shippori Mincho (FONTDASU), Yuji Syuku (Kinuta Font Factory) — Google Fonts, SIL Open Font License 1.1 (subsets in fonts/).
